{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國堪薩斯州有汽車衝入一個足球比賽現場，造成兩人死亡，司機被拘留。</p><p></p><p>事發在威奇托市，當時正進行青少年足球賽，警方及救援人員到場。兩名死者包括一名6歲男童，另外有11人受傷送院，由5歲至68歲。警方指涉事汽車上還有兩名兒童，正調查事發經過及原因。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T08:18:57.712894+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T10:57:43.726943+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T08:17:34.887714+00:00","content_hash":"3384c872b3dfa660631f7323e8b2b3448a5f211090e715c406c7e9fee662a54a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}